WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Light and Airy Whipped Frosting. 5 min · 4 servings · American

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Ingredients: 5. 8 ounces cream cheese; 1 cup powdered sugar; 1 pinch salt; 1 1/2 teaspoons vanilla

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 1. Using a whisk attachment on a stand mixer (use one if you have it), beat cream cheese until smooth and creamy.

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Step 2. Add powdered sugar, vanilla, and a pinch of salt; beat until smooth. Scrape down the bowl.

5
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Step 3. With the mixer running, drizzle in the cream steadily (adding it all at once can cause lumps). Continue beating several minutes until smooth, fluffy,…

6
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.000
You're ready. Use Make It for checkboxes on the page.
